{"id":"6d783b088eed1da1","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-binary-relation.md","title":"Binary Relation","display":"df-binary-relation — Binary Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-binary-relation","aliases":["58-df-binary-relation","Binary Relation","58-df-zfc-binary-relation"],"display":"df-binary-relation — Binary Relation","depends_on":["[[58-df-cartesian-product]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-binary-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-binary-relation</span><span>Binary Relation</span><span>58-df-zfc-binary-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-binary-relation — Binary Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"459559f62cf1b044\" href=\"?note=459559f62cf1b044\" title=\"58-df-cartesian-product\">58-df-cartesian-product</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,R\\in V\">\\(A,B,R\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(-)\\times(-):V^2\\to V\">\\((-)\\times(-):V^2\\to V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\times B\\in V\">\\(A\\times B\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"459559f62cf1b044\" href=\"?note=459559f62cf1b044\" title=\"58-df-cartesian-product\">58-df-cartesian-product</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Refl},\\operatorname{Sym},\\operatorname{Trans},\\operatorname{Equiv}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Refl},\\operatorname{Sym},\\operatorname{Trans},\\operatorname{Equiv}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary\\text{-}relation\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S(R,A,B)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times B\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary\\text{-}relation\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S(R,A,B)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times B\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary\\text{-}relation\\text{-}reflexive} \\vdash \\operatorname{Refl}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,a\\rangle\\in R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary\\text{-}relation\\text{-}reflexive} \\vdash \\operatorname{Refl}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,a\\rangle\\in R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary\\text{-}relation\\text{-}symmetric} \\vdash \\operatorname{Sym}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle b,a\\rangle\\in R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary\\text{-}relation\\text{-}symmetric} \\vdash \\operatorname{Sym}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle b,a\\rangle\\in R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary\\text{-}relation\\text{-}transitive} \\vdash \\operatorname{Trans}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary\\text{-}relation\\text{-}transitive} \\vdash \\operatorname{Trans}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary\\text{-}relation\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\operatorname{Equiv}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Refl}(R,A)\\land\\operatorname{Sym}(R,A)\\land\\operatorname{Trans}(R,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary\\text{-}relation\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\operatorname{Equiv}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Refl}(R,A)\\land\\operatorname{Sym}(R,A)\\land\\operatorname{Trans}(R,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Binary relation: subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\times B\">\\(A \\times B\\)</span>; generalizes function</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-binary-relation</code> is merged here.</li>\n<li>Function: special relation where each <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> has exactly one <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span></li>\n<li>Partial order: reflexive + antisymmetric + transitive; preorder if no antisymmetry</li>\n<li>Compatibility: relation compatible with algebraic structure if respects operations</li>\n<li>The product operator and all four relation properties have explicit domains and codomains; no English-only type convention is needed.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Davey and Priestley, Introduction to Lattices and Order</li>\n<li>Kunen, Set Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cartesian-product","status":"resolved","id":"459559f62cf1b044","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cartesian-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cartesian-product","status":"resolved","id":"459559f62cf1b044","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(-)\\times(-):V^2\\to V$ and $A\\times B\\in V$ (see [[58-df-cartesian-product]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"(-)\\times(-):V^2\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\times B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Refl},\\operatorname{Sym},\\operatorname{Trans},\\operatorname{Equiv}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary\\text{-}relation\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S(R,A,B)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times B","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary\\text{-}relation\\text{-}reflexive} \\vdash \\operatorname{Refl}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,a\\rangle\\in R)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary\\text{-}relation\\text{-}symmetric} \\vdash \\operatorname{Sym}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle b,a\\rangle\\in R)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary\\text{-}relation\\text{-}transitive} \\vdash \\operatorname{Trans}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in R)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary\\text{-}relation\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\operatorname{Equiv}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Refl}(R,A)\\land\\operatorname{Sym}(R,A)\\land\\operatorname{Trans}(R,A)","display":true},{"tex":"A \\times B","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false}],"bytes":2146,"backlinks":[{"id":"1a891abf5fe2909c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$A,R\\in V$ and $\\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[58-df-binary-relation]])"},{"id":"6f5c1c06855096fa","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-187","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-binary-relation.md|58-df-binary-relation]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["459559f62cf1b044"]}